{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41196","headline":"白菊 · 罗绍威","name":"白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽被风霜竞欲催，皎然颜色不低摧。\n已疑素手能妆出，又似金钱未染来。\n香散自宜飘渌酒，叶交仍得荫苍苔。\n寻思闭户中宵见，应认寒窗雪一堆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗绍威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}